OL,3,AShootings surge as drug gangs torment
OL,4,ABrussels
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast Monday night, drug gangs turned
OL,7,FSalvatore's pizzeria in Brussels into a
OL,8,Fcrime scene.
OL,10,F"We dropped to the floor. I had clients
OL,11,Feating on the terrace with children.
OL,12,FLook, we can see the bullet impacts
OL,13,Feverywhere."
OL,15,FHis restaurant sits on a pretty little
OL,16,Fsquare in St Gilles. It's a central
OL,17,Farea of the city, close to the
OL,18,Finternational Midi train station, where
OL,19,Fpassengers arrive on trains from London
OL,20,Fand Paris.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
