OL,3,AShootings surge as drug gangs torment
OL,4,ABrussels
OL,5,
OL,6,FShootings related to drug trafficking
OL,7,Fhave become routine in the Belgian
OL,8,Fcapital over the past couple of years.
OL,9,FThere were over 100 in 2025 alone, and
OL,10,Fmore than 65 shootings so far this
OL,11,Fyear.
